  "content": "<h2>模组介绍</h2><p>Photon是一款为《我的世界》开发的视觉特效编辑器模组，其设计灵感来源于Unity引擎。</p><p>它完整移植了Unity的粒子系统与拖尾系统，既能帮助模组开发者为其作品创建特效，也能让玩家通过指令直接体验特效。</p><p>本模组的初衷是让热爱视觉特效的玩家无需被复杂的技术门槛和数学问题困扰。其强大的创造性将助您实现天马行空的场景构想！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Discord社区：<span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbkJVc1Y4b2Z0ak9LYlVBWWVFUEVmR3l6Q2E0Z3xBQ3Jtc0ttUFA5OEstbllEdEc3LXJ3bk4yOU1uTzdFd04wRThCYTVzYU9sRV9DWTI4aVZqMUJhNV9IZEg5SGNkbmMxeGJWbm9KSWhfdWVuLTBISlpEa0FqZUV3Z3Z5dUJNWFFIM0pVeVAwdlgyazR5dGxYRkRtdw&amp;q=https://discord.com/invite/sDdf2yD9bh&amp;v=rdB0qVXRgaY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.com/invite/sDdf2yD9bh</a></span></p><p>GitHub仓库：<span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbEtLNFRscUFnVGxFVHFndXB2dTY4azE2ZC1Vd3xBQ3Jtc0tuRUFveDNEZmV3d0lfanFIcmxHcWttOUVZdnRZTVltUWFWTDJZTUs0THBCRzZoVjltUXF4SzJPQm9aclR3YTlTV3Vkd1YyVmF5QlJHVzBmSnhiX3ZsazFGTEppTUhGeGFlbkpLUFlBamVLZFVnTHA0UQ&amp;q=https://github.com/Low-Drag-MC/Photon&amp;v=rdB0qVXRgaY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/Low-Drag-MC/Photon</a></span></p><p><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1fXFaWheYvc\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>效果展示</h2><h4 style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Unity同款粒子系统</strong></h4><p><strong><span><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/gzevkJbM/images/7de2e2d9457720fdd8b37ea465a55aa5366af998.png\" width=\"747\" height=\"435\"></span></strong></p><h4>&nbsp;</h4><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong>拖尾特效</strong></h4><p><strong><span><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/gzevkJbM/images/18ef43b5b292df82cf807151cf5432505dc2daeb.png\" width=\"750\" height=\"431\"></span></strong></p><h4>&nbsp;</h4><h4>&nbsp;</h4><h4><strong>自定义着色器材质</strong></h4><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/gzevkJbM/images/aaf3fa1dfbf713235ef20a2a6fe6c7a1f5c4a0ab.png\" width=\"746\" height=\"430\"></strong></span></p><h4>&nbsp;</h4><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>内置泛光效果（无需着色器模组）</strong></span></h4><p><span><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/gzevkJbM/images/72ad816effd79b7add700f48f5d55625262c85a7.png\" width=\"751\" height=\"447\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong>基于网格的粒子形态</strong></h4><p><span><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/gzevkJbM/images/69d93cdd3e19d3cf9dbb8c43be39c2826d502e28.png\" width=\"750\" height=\"418\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong>物理系统</strong></h4><p><span><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/gzevkJbM/images/a5c881645b98ca10358b9761451c63d70d51d1b2.png\" width=\"749\" height=\"404\"></span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong>着色器模组兼容支持&nbsp;</strong></h4><p><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1116011072298680320/1117010580960722954/image.png\" width=\"748\" height=\"406\"></strong></p>",
